UID:yNSsPZMVEK
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nGathering audio from actual phone
  conversations\, Kaouther Ben Hania’s devastating film recounts the stor
 y behind the murder of Hind Rajab. Golden Globe nominee: Best Motion Pictu
 re - Non-English Language.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-
 voice-of-hind-rajab\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
